### SC-009 – Tingkat Adopsi Pengguna (User Adoption Rate)

| Attribute | Description |
| --- | --- |
| Success Criteria ID | SC-009 |
| Name | Tingkat Adopsi Pengguna (User Adoption Rate) |
| Category | Operational Success Metrics |
